 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "FoodDeliverySystem(restaurants, menu) takes restaurants as [restaurantId, x, y] rows (unique ids, integer coordinates) and menu as [restaurantId, item, price] rows (known restaurant, each restaurant lists an item at most once, positive integer price). Delivery time equals the Manhattan distance |x - userX| + |y - userY| (speed 1). getBestOption(item, userX, userY) returns [lowest price of item over all restaurants offering it, smallest delivery time over those restaurants]; the two minima may come from different restaurants; [-1, -1] when nobody offers the item. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
